&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Founding Business Development Representative&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Location: Remote&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Compensation: $80,000-90,000 OTE ($50,000-60,000 base), uncapped commission&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About CueBox&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://getcuebox.com/&quot;&gt;CueBox&lt;/a&gt; is a fast-growing startup building a modern, all-in-one ticketing, fundraising, and marketing CRM software for performing arts organizations. Theaters, symphonies, operas, ballets, choruses, and performing arts centers are vital to their communities — but most are stuck running on antiquated technology that gets in the way of doing their best work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;CueBox changes that. Our software directly grows our customers&#39; revenue (ticketing and donations), improves the patron and donor experience, and gives staff their time back from manual work. We have a growing customer base across the US who genuinely love the product, and we&#39;re looking to expand the team that gets CueBox in front of more arts organizations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;CueBox works with orgs across the US including El Paso Symphony, HERE Arts Center in NYC and more. One of the music orgs that CueBox works with increased ticket sales by &amp;gt;30% and ticket donations by 5x in several months after switching over to CueBox.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Overview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re hiring our founding business development representatives (BDRs) to drive the top of our sales funnel. You&#39;ll own outbound prospecting into performing arts organizations across the US — building lists, running multi-channel outreach, qualifying inbound leads, and booking discovery calls for our sales team. &lt;strong&gt;This is a high-impact role at a small and fast-moving company: your work directly shapes pipeline and revenue, you’ll partner directly with our CEO/co-founder, and you&#39;ll have the opportunity to grow into an account executive role.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compensation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Compensation: $80,000-90,000 OTE ($50,000-60,000 base), uncapped commission&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location (Remote)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are open to remote candidates based in the US. We do have an office in NYC that you can optionally come into some days.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run outbound prospecting campaigns (cold emails, calls, LinkedIn outreaches) into performing arts organizations
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continuously test and improve outreach: subject lines, sequences, talk tracks and more&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build outbound prospecting lists by using a range of different sources (including industry lists, industry database, online web research, sales tools) for cold outreach&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Research target accounts and personalize outreach to the executive decision makers and key influencers (fundraising, marketing, box office)
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understand customers’ key goals and pain points to conduct effective initial cold calls and write relevant outbound messages&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Book discovery meetings for the sales team, with clean handoffs and context&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain accurate, up-to-date records in our CRM and sales engagement tools (Hubspot)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hit and exceed monthly activity and meeting targets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Attend industry conferences and events to showcase CueBox&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Share what you&#39;re hearing from prospects with leadership — your feedback will shape our roadmap&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What We&#39;re Looking For&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;1–2+ years of BDR/SDR experience in B2B software sales, with a track record of hitting or exceeding quota&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong written communication skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort on the phone and confidence with cold-calling&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Organized and self-motivated — you can manage your own pipeline, follow-ups, and time without close supervision&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Genuinely curious about prospects&#39; businesses and CueBox’s product&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good at asking questions and listening&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Resilient and coachable&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with modern sales tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;(Bonus) Experience selling into SMB or mid-market&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;(Bonus) Experience selling into nonprofits or education verticals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;(Bonus) Personal arts/music-related experience or interest&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Additional Information&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Opportunity to grow to account executive role&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Product &amp;amp; industry training bootcamp to help BDR ramp&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interview process:
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Introductory call&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mock written assignment &amp;amp; mock cold call&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Final round interview&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;$80,000-90,000 OTE ($50,000-60,000 base)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Medical, dental, and vision insurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive equity package&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Complimentary one-medical membership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;401k&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Note: We do not offer visa sponsorship at this time.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Apply&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We hope you’re excited to join us as we transform the performing arts and cultural industry! Please apply below.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About CueBox&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;CueBox is an early-stage startup building all-in-one software for performing arts and cultural organizations. These organizations inspire, connect and delight us; yet, they’ve been underserved by technology providers. Our product saves them time and grows their revenue by streamlining fundraising, ticketing, marketing, education and more, which is why we have such a fast-growing and happy customer base!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are quickly expanding into more segments across the country, and we’re looking for a talented and driven engineer to help our small team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;CueBox is headquartered in New York City, and we are a hybrid workplace. Our team is in the office 3 days a week, Tuesday–Thursday.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About You&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for backend-leaning full-stack engineers who love building delightful and performant products, are excited to work hard at a mission-oriented startup, and want to collaborate with us in shaping the culture of a growing team!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;4+ years of professional software engineering experience&lt;/strong&gt;, including prior experience at an early or mid stage startup.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bachelor’s degree or higher in Computer Science or a related technical field&lt;/strong&gt; (or equivalent practical experience).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Proven track record of building performant, data-intensive applications using a strongly typed backend language&lt;/strong&gt; in a complex domain.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong product sense and high customer empathy; genuine desire to build the best possible product for our users.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excels at thoughtful API design and database schema/query design.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with integrating Backend APIs with a TypeScript/React frontend.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work independently and successfully own large or ambiguous problem areas.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Effective verbal and written communication for both technical and nontechnical audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with online payments, consumer facing flows, or reporting/analytics for large datasets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;(Nice-to-Have) Experience building AI-enabled features in SaaS products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This role reports directly to the Head of Engineering. You will:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build, maintain and scale our backend systems as we grow.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pioneer new features and product areas.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Meaningfully influence technical direction as the product evolves, including how to further integrate AI into our product.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to a culture of engineering excellence through technical design discussion, code review, and documentation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work in our current tech stack: Golang/Protobuf/Postgres backend; React/Next.js/Chakra UI frontend; Python data pipelines; hosted on GCP.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Current and Upcoming Projects include:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Building brand new AI features such as Dynamic Pricing, MCP Connection and AI Email Composer&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improving performance, user experience and accessibility of consumer-facing checkout flows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Scaling up and rearchitecting our backend systems to handle more user traffic and heavier analytics workloads.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continuing to enhance our payments processing functionality, including split payments, Pay Later, and Fraud Prevention.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Summary of Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Base salary ~$145–185k&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive equity package&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Medical, dental, and vision insurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Complimentary one-medical membership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;401k&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Note: We do not offer visa sponsorship at this time.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
